WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.437
A whole is shared into two equal pieces. What is one piece called? Let us think

00:00:05.437 --> 00:00:10.346
carefully. Equal parts must have the same size. Count how many equal pieces make the

00:00:10.346 --> 00:00:12.637
whole. The answer is one-half. Great work!

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.857
A whole is shared into four equal pieces. What is one piece called? Let us think

00:00:18.857 --> 00:00:23.927
carefully. Equal parts must have the same size. Count how many equal pieces make the

00:00:23.927 --> 00:00:26.293
whole. The answer is one-quarter. Great work!

00:00:27.117 --> 00:00:31.955
Are unequal pieces called halves? Let us think carefully. Equal parts must have the

00:00:31.955 --> 00:00:37.485
same size. Count how many equal pieces make the whole. The answer is No. Great work!

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:43.295
How many equal halves make a whole? Let us think carefully. Equal parts must have the

00:00:43.295 --> 00:00:48.223
same size. Count how many equal pieces make the whole. The answer is Two. Great work!
